REMARK PROMEGA Protein Proline Omega Angle Prediction 
REMARK  Summary table for WT_53105_promega.tab
REMARK 
REMARK  RESID is the residue number of Pro
REMARK 
REMARK  RESNAME_R1 is the residue prior to Pro
REMARK 
REMARK  RESNAME_R3 is the residue next to Pro
REMARK 
REMARK  CS_CNT is the number of chemical shifts
REMARK 
REMARK  CG_SHIFT is the Pro CG chemical shift
REMARK 
REMARK  P_CIS is the likelihood of Pro to be in cis form, 
REMARK  calculated by Eq. 5 of the reference
REMARK 
REMARK  P_CIS_NORM is the normalized likelihood of Pro to be 
REMARK  in cis form, calculated by Eq. 6 of the reference
REMARK 
REMARK Reference:
REMARK  Y. Shen and A. Bax: Prediction of Xaa-Pro peptide bond
REMARK  conformation from sequence and chemical shifts.
REMARK  J. Biomol. NMR 46, 199-204 (2010).
REMARK 
REMARK  PROMEGA Version 1.40F1 Rev 2012.029.12.03 PROMEGA_INFO


